<!-- ── AUTH FLOW SPEC ── -->
<div class="section" id="auth">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag">Authentication</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Complete <span>Auth System</span></h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Every authentication pathway, token strategy, and security consideration documented for zero-ambiguity implementation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flow-grid">
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">1</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">📧</div>
      <div class="flow-title">Email / Password Flow</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>User enters email + password on login screen</li>
        <li>Frontend validates: email format, password min 8 chars</li>
        <li>POST /auth/login → server returns JWT access token (15min) + refresh token (30 days)</li>
        <li>Access token stored in memory (NOT localStorage)</li>
        <li>Refresh token stored in httpOnly cookie</li>
        <li>Auto-refresh when access token expires via silent renew</li>
        <li>On logout: DELETE /auth/logout, clear cookie + memory</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">2</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">🔴</div>
      <div class="flow-title">Google OAuth 2.0 Flow</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>User taps "Continue with Google" button</li>
        <li>Redirect to Google OAuth consent screen</li>
        <li>Google returns auth code to callback URL</li>
        <li>Backend exchanges code for Google tokens via Google API</li>
        <li>Server checks if email exists → login or auto-register</li>
        <li>New users skip email verification, go directly to onboarding</li>
        <li>Return CareerAI JWT pair identical to email flow</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">3</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">📝</div>
      <div class="flow-title">New User Registration</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>User fills first name, last name, email, password</li>
        <li>Frontend: real-time password strength meter (weak/fair/strong)</li>
        <li>POST /auth/register → server sends OTP to email</li>
        <li>OTP verification screen: 6-digit code, 5-minute expiry, 3 attempts</li>
        <li>On verify → account activated, JWT issued</li>
        <li>Redirect to 5-step onboarding wizard</li>
        <li>Onboarding data saved incrementally (can resume later)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">4</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">🔑</div>
      <div class="flow-title">Password Reset Flow</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>User taps "Forgot Password?" on login screen</li>
        <li>Enter email → POST /auth/forgot-password</li>
        <li>Server sends password reset link (expires in 1hr)</li>
        <li>Clicking link opens in-app browser → validates token</li>
        <li>User sets new password (must differ from last 3)</li>
        <li>POST /auth/reset-password with token + new password</li>
        <li>All active sessions invalidated, user re-logged in</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">5</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">🛡️</div>
      <div class="flow-title">Security &amp; Role System</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>Roles: Student | Professional | Mentor | Admin | Super Admin</li>
        <li>Role stored in JWT payload claims</li>
        <li>Mentors require profile verification (document upload + admin approval)</li>
        <li>Rate limiting: 5 failed login attempts → 15min account lock</li>
        <li>All auth endpoints behind HTTPS only</li>
        <li>CSRF protection via double-submit cookie pattern</li>
        <li>Audit logs for all auth events (login, logout, password change)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <div class="flow-num">6</div>
      <div class="flow-icon">📱</div>
      <div class="flow-title">Biometric &amp; Session</div>
      <ul class="flow-steps">
        <li>On supported devices: offer Face ID / Fingerprint after first login</li>
        <li>Biometric wraps refresh token retrieval (not stores password)</li>
        <li>"Remember this device for 30 days" checkbox</li>
        <li>Session dashboard: view all active sessions with device info</li>
        <li>One-tap revoke any session remotely</li>
        <li>Push notification on new device login</li>
        <li>Google Sign-In handled via expo-auth-session (mobile)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

